When adding a paramater for a Card, don't forget to update the following files:
    app/models/card.rb
    app/controllers/cards_controller.rb

    app/helpers/html_helper.rb (Based on need)
    
    db/schema.rb
    db/schema_sqlite.rb

    After the schema has been updated, you need to do bin/setup --reset to reset the database and add the new data.

    